🎧 Headphones Landing Page
Welcome! This is a clean and modern Headphones landing page, built using only HTML, CSS, and a little JavaScript. It's fully responsive, meaning it looks great on both desktop and mobile screens.

📱 About the Project
This page showcases a fictional headphones brand with stylish design, smooth user interaction, and mobile support. It features:

A full-screen hero section

A responsive navigation bar with a hamburger menu on mobile

A features section with icons

An engaging stats section

A simple contact form

A clean footer with social media icons

💻 How It Works
Mobile-Friendly: When the screen width is 480px or less, the layout switches to a mobile view with a dropdown menu.

Hover Interactions:

All links change color to #FF6565 when hovered or clicked.

The call-to-action buttons become slightly transparent on hover/click (opacity: 0.9).

Content Layout: All sections are centered and limited to a maximum width of 1000px for readability.




✅ No setup or frameworks needed — just your browser!

